<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83700" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεον-ασμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>superabundance, excess,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγρότητος, τῶν μερῶν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				780a20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				770b28
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Antr.</u>
				11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεονασμοὶ λαλιᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.650e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>surplus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PRyl.
				213.82
			</span></i> (pl., <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				4296.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>usury,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				25.37
			</span></i>, Critodem. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(1).260
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Rhet.
			and Gramm., <i>use of redundant words,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				267.14
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>lengthening</i> of clauses, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μείωσις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>repetition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Timae.
				71
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
